message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: 'MATLAB code for "Tau creates spatially moving hotspots of amyloid-β secondary nucleation: a reaction–diffusion model"'
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of the one-dimensional reaction–diffusion model of
  tau-driven, spatially moving hotspots of amyloid-β secondary nucleation.
  Includes the method-of-lines solver, the diagnostic routines, the reference
  and dimensionally mapped parameter sets, a driver that reproduces every
  numerical result quoted in Sections 4 and 5 of the manuscript, and a script
  that regenerates Figs. 2–9. Base MATLAB only; no toolboxes required.
type: software
